WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.840
先抱一下。抱大一点。
One hug first. A big one.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.000
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：夸咪摆得真好
You: Praise Mi, it's arranged so nicely

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.680
咪本来就知道。
Mii knew.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.280
现在咪有个计划。
Now Mii has a plan.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：小包里装了什么呀？给我看看
You: What's in the little bag? Let me see

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:05.040
只是个包。没什么特别的。
Just a bag. Nothing special.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.620
钥匙。咪有计划。果酱。
Keys. Mii has a plan. Jam.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：你一只小猫怎么买？钱呢，你带了吗
You: How does a little cat even buy things? What about the money, did you bring any?

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.690
钱？咪有更好的办法。
Money? Mii has a better plan.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.160
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:31.460
不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：笑着夸这个爪印吐司
You: Smile and praise the paw-print toast

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.970
咪是故意的。大部分是。
Mii meant it. Mostly.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.830
要再买果酱。咪很快回来。
Need more jam. Mii will be back soon.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：你够得着门把手吗？我看你怎么开门
You: Can you even reach the door handle? Let me see how you open the door

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.670
门？小事。
Door? Easy.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.950
咪本来就知道。是门太高了。
Mii knew. It's just tall.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：那我抱你起来，你自己试试开门
You: Then I'll pick you up, and you try opening the door yourself

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.920
咪能行的。差不多吧。
Mii can do it. Mostly.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.960
本来就知道，咪说过的。
Told you. Mii knew.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：夸咪真棒，让它快去快回
You: Praise Mi, great job. Tell it to hurry there and back

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.230
咪做到了。咪本来就知道。
Mii did it. Mii knew.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.770
我会很快的。
I'll be quick.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:40.150
一罐果酱。咪是专业的。
One jam. Mii is a pro.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：你怎么付钱的呀？收银员没吓一跳吗
You: How did you pay? Didn't the cashier get startled?

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:47.570
咪：付钱？咪有办法。
Pay? Mii has a plan.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.950
咪：没人被吓到。大概。
Nobody was scared. Mostly.

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:00.880
咪：酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.640
你：没事，我来帮你，咱们一起把锅刷干净
You: It's fine, I'll help you. Let's scrub the pan clean together

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.840
咱们一起刷吗？
We clean it together?

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.080
咪本来就知道。差不多。
Mii knew. Mostly.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.470
第二回合。准备好了吗？
Round two. Ready?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.240
你：低头尝一口，夸夸咪
You: Take a bite and praise Mi

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.740
小小一口。咪吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.400
味道如何？
How is it?

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.030
咪本来就知道。差不多。
Mii knew. Mostly.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.840
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口
You: Yummy, so yummy, I want more. Feed me another bite

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.640
咪吹两下，把碗推近。
Second bite. Mii blew twice.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.620
锅空了。去餐桌。
The pot is empty. Table next.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.090
咪还有。也许。
Mii has more. Maybe.
